  "prompt": "A manager checks December 2025 so far on the morning of 15 December 2025, so December's orders run from 1 to 14 December (order dates are UTC days). Compare them with the same days of November, 1 to 14 November 2025, for each parent category. The 1st and the 14th are both included in each period. Return four columns, in this order: parent_category, nov_revenue_eur, dec_revenue_eur and change_eur, December's net revenue minus November's. Return one row for each parent category with sales in either period (a parent category with sales in neither is left out); a period with no sales shows 0. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "parent_category",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "nov_revenue_eur",
